The derivation chain is:

```
Photon
  → massless spin-1
  → 2 helicity states
  → each has 2 real components (Q, P)
  → 4D phase space (Q₁, P₁, Q₂, P₂)
  → Wick rotation θ
  → metric ds² = −Q₁² + P₁² + Q₂² + P₂²
  → periodic with period 2π
  → big bang every π
  → d = 4
```

Every step is forced by the physics.

